sws-schemas-import-created:
Success message in the import dialog listing the schemas the import created. Parameters:
* $1 - the number of schemas
* $2 - their names, separated by {{msg-mw|comma-separator}}

sws-schemas-import-replaced:
Success message in the import dialog listing the existing schemas the import replaced. Parameters:
* $1 - the number of schemas
* $2 - their names, separated by {{msg-mw|comma-separator}}

sws-layout-display-no-rules-dependent:
Shown instead of {{msg-mw|sws-layout-display-no-rules}} on a layout's page and in its editor when the layout's schema has relation properties whose values are dependent subjects, which a view without display rules leaves out. Parameters:
* $1 - the names of those properties, separated by {{msg-mw|comma-separator}}
* $2 - the number of those properties, for PLURAL

sws-severity-input-label:
Accessible name and tooltip of the severity control next to a Constraint in the schema editor. Parameters:
* $1 - the label of the Constraint's own control, e.g. {{msg-mw|sws-property-editor-minimum}} or {{msg-mw|sws-property-editor-required}}
* $2 - the current severity level, one of {{msg-mw|sws-severity-warning}} or {{msg-mw|sws-severity-error}}

sws-config-setting-data-languages:
Label of the list of languages for the dataLanguages setting in the form on the MediaWiki:SWS configuration page.

See also:
* {{msg-sws|sws-config-setting-data-languages-help}}

sws-config-editor-reset-label:
Accessible name of the link {{msg-sws|sws-config-editor-reset}}, naming the setting it belongs to.

Parameters:
* $1 - the setting's label as the form shows it, such as {{msg-sws|sws-config-setting-data-languages}} or {{msg-sws|sws-config-setting-auto-render-main-subject}}

sws-special-subject-referenced-by-proper:
Shown on [[Special:Subject]], under the "Referenced by" heading, in a Subject row's header line after the Schema name and statement count. Names the properties through which that Subject points at the displayed one, and must read naturally with a single name as well as a list.

Parameters:
* $1 - one or more property names, joined with {{msg-mw|comma-separator}}
